{"id":"A2-L053","title":"Verb + object + to-infinitive: form","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U04","focus":"Verb + object + to-infinitive — forma","targets":{"grammar":"Verb + object + to-infinitive — forma","pron":"gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["spice","remind","allow","steam","onion soup","chicken soup","soup spoon","big pot","sliced onion","boiling water","cold day","cooking steps","taste test","hot bowl","kitchen helper","soup bowl"],"field":"Experiências","genre":"Receita e instruções","skill":"Fala","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 53 · Verb + object + to-infinitive: form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verb + object + to-infinitive — forma.","**Pronúncia:** gonna e wanna (reconhecimento).","**16 palavras novas** (experiências).","**Texto do dia:** receita e instruções."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar want/ask/tell/need + pessoa + to + verbo numa receita."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["spice","tempero"],["remind","lembrar alguém"],["allow","permitir"],["steam","vapor"],["onion soup","onion soup"],["chicken soup","chicken soup"],["soup spoon","soup spoon"],["big pot","big pot"],["sliced onion","sliced onion"],["boiling water","boiling water"],["cold day","cold day"],["cooking steps","cooking steps"],["taste test","taste test"],["hot bowl","hot bowl"],["kitchen helper","kitchen helper"],["soup bowl","soup bowl"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A recipe","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Soup for a Cold Day","paras":["The cook **wants you to chop** two onions. She **asks Tom to boil** the water and **tells Mia to add** salt.","**Remind everyone to taste** the soup. A good cook **allows people to add** their own spices. Enjoy!"],"kicker":"RECIPE","by":"From a family book","gloss":[["remind","lembrar"],["allow","permitir"],["boil","ferver"],["spice","tempero"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The cook wants you to chop onions.","ans":"T","why":"wants you to chop."},{"q":"She tells Tom to chop the salt.","ans":"F","why":"boil water."},{"q":"People may add their own spices.","ans":"T","why":"allows people to add."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“allow” = ?","opts":["permitir","alcançar","alinhar"],"ans":0,"why":"allow."},{"q":"“remind” = ?","opts":["lembrar alguém","esquecer","recordar sozinho"],"ans":0,"why":"remind."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Verb + object + to-infinitive","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["want","**I want you to help.**"],["ask","**She asks Tom to boil water.**"],["tell","**He tells Mia to wait.**"],["remind","**Remind me to call.**"],["allow","**They allow us to enter.**"]],"cap":"Verb + object + to-infinitive"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Negativa: **not to**: *She told me not to touch it.* Objeto em forma de objeto: *me, you, him, her, us, them.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She wants me ___ onions. (chop)","a":"to chop","why":"want + obj + to."},{"s":"I asked him ___ the water. (boil)","a":"to boil","why":"ask + to."},{"s":"Remind me ___ salt. (add)","a":"to add","why":"remind + to."},{"s":"He told us ___ late. (not be)","a":"not to be","why":"not to."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["chop","picar"],["boil","ferver"],["spice","tempero"],["remind","lembrar alguém"],["allow","permitir"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["want","you","to","chop","the","onions","I"],"ans":"I want you to chop the onions","pt":"Quero que você pique as cebolas."},{"words":["remind","Mia","to","add","salt","Yes","And"],"ans":"Yes And remind Mia to add salt","pt":"Sim. E lembre a Mia de colocar sal."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"spice","pos":"word","pt":"tempero","ex":"A hot spice.","expt":"Um tempero forte."},{"w":"remind","pos":"word","pt":"lembrar alguém","ex":"Remind me.","expt":"Lembre-me."},{"w":"allow","pos":"word","pt":"permitir","ex":"Allow time.","expt":"Dê tempo."},{"w":"steam","pos":"word","pt":"vapor","ex":"Hot steam.","expt":"Vapor quente."},{"w":"onion soup","pos":"word","pt":"onion soup","ex":"sopa de cebola","expt":"Onion soup."},{"w":"chicken soup","pos":"word","pt":"chicken soup","ex":"sopa de galinha","expt":"Chicken soup."},{"w":"soup spoon","pos":"word","pt":"soup spoon","ex":"colher de sopa","expt":"A soup spoon."},{"w":"big pot","pos":"word","pt":"big pot","ex":"panela grande","expt":"A big pot."},{"w":"sliced onion","pos":"word","pt":"sliced onion","ex":"cebola fatiada","expt":"Sliced onion."},{"w":"boiling water","pos":"word","pt":"boiling water","ex":"água fervente","expt":"Boiling water."},{"w":"cold day","pos":"word","pt":"cold day","ex":"dia frio","expt":"A cold day."},{"w":"cooking steps","pos":"word","pt":"cooking steps","ex":"passos da receita","expt":"Cooking steps."},{"w":"taste test","pos":"word","pt":"taste test","ex":"prova de sabor","expt":"A taste test."},{"w":"hot bowl","pos":"word","pt":"hot bowl","ex":"tigela quente","expt":"A hot bowl."},{"w":"kitchen helper","pos":"word","pt":"kitchen helper","ex":"ajudante de cozinha","expt":"A kitchen helper."},{"w":"soup bowl","pos":"word","pt":"soup bowl","ex":"tigela de sopa","expt":"Soup bowl."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**I want you to chop the onions.** — Quero que você pique as cebolas.","**Yes. And remind Mia to add salt.** — Sim. E lembre a Mia de colocar sal.","**Will do!** — Pode deixar!","**I tend to think…** — Costumo achar…","**I’m inclined to agree.** — Tendo a concordar.","**That’s not how I see it.** — Não vejo assim.","**I take your point.** — Entendo seu argumento."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"happen","pt":"acontecer","forms":[["I / you / we / they happen","What happened?"],["he / she / it happens","It happens often."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"In the kitchen","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"In the kitchen","lines":[["Chef","I want you to chop the onions.","Quero que você pique as cebolas."],["Tom","OK. Do you want me to boil the water?","Quer que eu ferva a água?"],["Chef","Yes. And remind Mia to add salt.","Sim. E lembre a Mia de colocar sal."],["Tom","Will do!","Pode deixar!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","items":[{"label":"gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","note":"Na fala: going to → gonna, want to → wanna. Reconheça; na escrita use a forma completa.","words":["I’m gonna go","I wanna eat","What are you gonna do?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you want someone to do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I want you to help me."},{"q":"Ask someone to do something.","pt":"Peça.","model":"Can you ask him to wait?"},{"q":"Remind a friend.","pt":"Lembre.","model":"Remind me to call."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with verb + object + to.","model":"I want you to chop the onions. She asks Tom to boil the water. He tells Mia to add salt. Remind me to taste it. They allow us to add spices.","checklist":["Usei **obj + to**","Usei **4 verbos**","Usei **not to**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “chop” mean?","opts":["picar","ferver","lembrar alguém"],"ans":0,"why":"**chop** = picar."},{"q":"What does “boil” mean?","opts":["tempero","ferver","permitir"],"ans":1,"why":"**boil** = ferver."},{"q":"What does “spice” mean?","opts":["lembrar alguém","panela","tempero"],"ans":2,"why":"**spice** = tempero."},{"q":"What does “remind” mean?","opts":["lembrar alguém","permitir","concha"],"ans":0,"why":"**remind** = lembrar alguém."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}